The following skills in this directory are derived from the `skills/engineering`
and `skills/productivity` sets of https://github.com/mattpocock/skills, at commit
8b36d4fb2635b3c21998dcd8144439c9e5ba7302, and are covered by the MIT license
reproduced below:

  ask, code-review, codebase-design, diagnosing-bugs, domain-modeling,
  grill-with-docs, grilling, handoff, implement, improve-codebase-architecture,
  prototype, research, resolving-merge-conflicts, setup, tdd, to-spec,
  to-tickets, triage, wayfinder, wizard

These files have been modified for the Pi coding agent: the Codex-specific
`agents/openai.yaml` files were removed, sub-agent invocations were rewritten to
Pi's `subagent_delegate` tool and role names, `/clear` was renamed to Pi's
`/new`, `CLAUDE.md` write targets were replaced with `AGENTS.md`, and the
`setup-matt-pocock-skills` and `ask-matt` skills were renamed to `setup` and
`ask`.

The `commit` and `pr` skills in this directory are original pi-square work and
are covered by the pi-square LICENSE at the repository root, not by the license
below.

